  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Transition Acceleration Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity commitment of up to USD 25 million in favour of African Transition  Acceleration Fund (the&quot;Fund&quot;), an en commandite partnership in South Africa.  The Fund will be managed by African Infrastructure Investment Managers (the &quot;Fund Manager&quot;).  The Fund will seek to invest in hard assets energy transition businesses on the  African continent with a significant focus on EBRD&apos;s Countries of  Operations. The Fund Manager will focus on three core thematic decarbonization  verticals: (i) clean electrons, (ii) clean molecules and (iii) sustainable  transportation.</narrative>
  </description>
